      "author": "github-actions[bot]",
      "description": "## Highlights\n\n- Cross-property dragging is now enabled by default for fresh installs and settings that do not already specify a preference, matching the README demonstration.\n- Cross-property dragging can still be disabled under **Settings → Value drag**.\n- Existing explicit opt-outs remain respected.\n\n## Maintenance\n\n- Centralized suggestion visibility handling so menu presentation and keyboard navigation share one contract.\n- Expanded lint and type-check coverage to tests, scripts, and tool configuration.\n- Split frontmatter tests by responsibility for easier maintenance and review.\n- Made the bug-report version prompt independent of a specific release number.\n\n## Compatibility\n\n- Requires Obsidian 1.12.7 or later.\n- Cross-property moves remain limited to compatible top-level list properties in the same note.\n- Unsupported structures and cross-file targets continue to fail safely.\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/ZHYX91/obsidian-property-order/compare/0.2.1...0.3.0",
